!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1 = Library preparation were performed by Epibiotek (Guangzhou, China). Briefly, total RNA were treated to remove ribosomal RNA by using GeneRead™ rRNA Depletion Kit（Qiagen, Hilden, Germany, Cat No. 180211）. Ribosome depleted RNA was fragmented and then used for constructing strand-specific RNA libraries by using VAHTS Stranded RNA-seq Library Prep Kit for Illumina (Vazyme, Nanjing, China, Cat. No NR602) accoding to manufacturer instructions.
!Sample_data_processing = CLC Genomics Workbench v 11.0.1
!Sample_data_processing = Sequence reads were trimmed for adaptor sequence/low-quality sequence using CLC genomic benchwork (parameter- Quality limit: 0.05)
!Sample_data_processing = Trimmed sequence reads were mapped to GrCM38/mm10 using CLC genomic benchwork (parameters- mismath cost: 2 insertion cost: 3 deletion cost: 3 length fraction: 0.8 similarity fraction: 0.8)
!Sample_data_processing = Read count extraction and normalization were performed using CLC genomic benchwork
!Sample_data_processing = Assembly: hg38
